We are facing the Performance Issue after adding 2 Nodes to the production
Cluster.
Now it is a 4 node cluster. The same CVS checkout takes 1.5 times time now
and also 
access of file system hangs in between.

The details of Compaq Cluster setup here are as below:

Machines        : 4 COMPAQ DEC6600 DS20E
O.S             : TruUnix5.1A and TruCluster 5.1A. with Patch Kit 4
CPU             : All machines have 1 CPU and 1GB RAM.
CPU Speed &     : Two Machines have EV6   (21264)  500Mhz Cache 4.0 MB
Type              Two machines have EV6.7 (21264A) 667Mhz Cache 8.0 MB
Memory Channel  : 2 CCMAB-AA connected thru Memory Channel Hub CCMHB-AA
MEMORY
Disk Storage    : RA7000 storage array with dual HSZ70 controllers and Dual
SCSI hubs.
                
