longer time. 
We are suspecting that CFS is causing this problem and some kernel
parameters of this needs to be tuned, but we are not sure about it.

If you can point me where to look for improving the degraded performance
after adding 2 nodes, it will be a grat help to us.
Any help would be a great help.

