This is a problem introduced by Patch Kit 2 and is known to HP. Was =
solved with a patch kit, not yet publicly available. A software contract =
is needed to obtain this from HP.

If you can't obtain the patch needed, try to use a pre-patch 2 copy of =
rpc.yppasswd.

Thanks to all who replied, especially to Ann Majeske who has, once again =
:), pointed me in the right direction.

All replies follow below.

Cheers
Pedro.

