---
Hi,

This is a known problem.  You have a couple options.   If you
have a support contract you can open a problem report to get
a copy of the fix.  If you don't have a support contract your best =
option would be to restore the rpc.yppasswdd file from the previous =
patch kit for now.  The fix should be in the next patch kit.

Ann

-------------------------------------------------------------------------=
---


