you mention but I have seen the messages as you describe;

Sep  4 15:52:05 myhost yppasswdd[526221]: now active and servicing =
client requests Sep  4 15:52:21 myhost yppasswdd[525058]: restarting =
after child exit with status: 75

It seems they appeared after PK2 as you suggest but only intermittently =
and they disappeared entirely after a while. Unfortunately, I can't =
correlate that with any particular action I took - given that I was =
preoccupied with more serious Tru64 bugs at the time.

I assume the exit code is as 'errno.h' says;

#define EPROGMISMATCH   75              /* Program version wrong */

which isn't particularly helpful. At this point it would be nice to =
reach=20
for the source code...

John P.

