Hello Managers,

I have a 2 node ES-40 cluster running version 5.1A patch kit one and has a oracle database.  I have been asked to come up with a solution that would provide the ability for the DBA's to send out file (mainly .pdf files)attachments using UNIX mail/mailx.  I have done a lot of research and have found several methods to accomplish the task, however, I would much like to get the thoughts of the forum, you guys.

