Hi managers,

we want to install a 2-node Cluster on a AS 1000 XP and AS 2100 3/500 with
SWXCR-04-controlled (HSZ40-type) shared disks and a LAN-direct-crossover-
Interconnect.
Starting with Tru64-Unix V5.1a (the ddr.dbase was modified for SWXCR) on the AS
1000 (member1) with clu_create and clu_add_member of AS 2100 (member2) worked
fine; apart from starting the X-server and building a new kernel on the member2! 
Even the internal RAID of member2 controlled by a Mylex-Controller was working.

