and the Mylex-controlled could no longer be found, resulting in a
DDR-base error !

Thus it seems that the above mentioned disks are no longer supported from
TruCluster 5.1a with PK4 .

Can anybody point out, which patch-kit propably makes the trouble and up to
which patch-kit I can update without loosing support for SWXCR- and
Mylex-Controller ? 


