mountpoint that is a CDSL, then also that whole filesystem is counted
towards the space required for that tar-file.  So unmount any filesystem
mounted on this member's CDSL's and redo the setup."

We had a couple of CDSL mounted file-systems that were being considered for
the upgrade sizing process. 

