1000 = 1000 Mps Ethernet half-duplex
2000 = 1000 Mps Ethernet full-duplex

and a suggestion:

I'd rather guess 1000/2000, and I'd use the lan_config command
in /etc/inet.local to set speed/fdx instead of ifconfig.

