Workflow application) running sendmail to communicate with an MS Exchange
5.5 (on Win NT4) mail server in such a manner that emails sent from the OW
application should be sent to the Exchange mail server to be sent to the
target internal user. Also, any email sent by any user should be accessible
by the OW user. This would mean that the Tru64 host merely acts as a mail
forwarder to the actual mail server (MS Exchange).

