Sorry for the long delay with this summary. This problem was low priority 
and it took this long to get back around to it.

Thanks  to all who replied. Suggestions were made to be certain to use 
/usr/bin/passwd and also to load Patch 5. Neither of these suggestions worked.

I still don't know the actual reason, but I had originally loaded the SSO 
subsets with the intention of testing some of those features. This includes 
Kerberos.
At the suggestion of HP support, I removed the SSODOC200 and SSOW2K200 
subsets and rebooted. This removed the Kerberos setup. It also resolved the 
problem.  HP is going to investigate further, but for now I can continue 
with the configuration of the system.

John




